{"name":"Anon","hex":"#bdbfc8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Anon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The name given when an author's name is unknown."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Anon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Anon (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Anon is the fourth studio album by Australian rock band Hands Like Houses, released on 12 October 2018 by UNFD and Hopeless Records. It was produced by Colin Brittain, Mike Green, Alex Prieto, and Erik Ron at Steakhouse Studios in Hollywood."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6b/Hands_like_houses_-_anon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anon_(album)","wikidata":"Q60838651"},{"title":"Anon (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Anon were an English rock band made up of pupils from Charterhouse School in Surrey. Members of the group would eventually merge with another Charterhouse group, called Garden Wall, to form the progressive rock band Genesis. The band formed in May 1965 and split up in December 1966. It originally consisted of Rivers Jobe (bass), Richard Macphail (vocals), Anthony Phillips, and Rob Tyrrell (drums). They were later joined by future Genesis guitarist/bassist Mike Rutherford on rhythm guitar. During a short period of time, Rutherford was forced to leave the band by his house master at Charterhouse and was replaced by Mike Colman."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anon_(band)","wikidata":"Q7713883"},{"title":"Anon (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Anon is a 2018 cyberpunk thriller film written and directed by Andrew Niccol. An international co-production of Canada, Germany and the United States, the film stars Clive Owen and Amanda Seyfried, with Colm Feore, Mark O'Brien, Sonya Walger, Joe Pingue and Iddo Goldberg appearing in supporting roles. Set in a futuristic world where privacy and anonymity no longer exist, the plot follows a troubled detective (Owen) who comes across a young woman (Seyfried) who has evaded the government's transparency system."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/55/Anon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anon_(film)","wikidata":"Q27957904"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey heron (00129p)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg","ratio":0.8691693290734824,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_heron_(00129p).jpg","share":0.32875},{"title":"Colmar - Unterlinden Museum - Saint Catherine and two donators, ca 1480 - Anonymous, fresco","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Saint_Catherine_and_two_donators%2C_ca_1480_-_Anonymous%2C_fresco.jpg/500px-Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Saint_Catherine_and_two_donators%2C_ca_1480_-_Anonymous%2C_fresco.jpg","ratio":1.333767926988266,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Saint_Catherine_and_two_donators,_ca_1480_-_Anonymous,_fresco.jpg","share":0.295},{"title":"Colmar - Unterlinden Museum - Crucifixion, ca 1480 - Anonymous, fresco","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Crucifixion%2C_ca_1480_-_Anonymous%2C_fresco.jpg/500px-Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Crucifixion%2C_ca_1480_-_Anonymous%2C_fresco.jpg","ratio":1.3335561497326203,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Crucifixion,_ca_1480_-_Anonymous,_fresco.jpg","share":0.2475},{"title":"Colmar - Unterlinden Museum - Medieval Baptismal font - Anonymous, Vosges sandstone - Comes from the Mittelwihr neighbourhood","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Colmar_-_Unterlinden_Museum_-_Medieval_Baptismal_font_-_Anonymous%2C_Vosges_sandstone_-_Comes_from_the_Mittelwihr_neighbo